#: ../../source/docs/copter-sitl-mavproxy-tutorial.rst:5
#: 23c15241414b46659d7e6fabc94fa7fc
msgid "Copter SITL/MAVProxy Tutorial"
msgstr "Copter SITL（软件在环仿真）/MAVProxy 教程"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-sitl-mavproxy-tutorial.rst:7
#: 2dae52c2cf9747ef8428530bc63c81b4
msgid ""
"This tutorial provides a basic walk-through of how to use :ref:`SITL "
"<sitl-simulator-software-in-the-loop>` and :ref:`MAVProxy documentation "
"<mavproxy:home>` for *Copter* testing."
msgstr ""
"本教程提供了如何将 :ref:`SITL（软件在环仿真） <sitl-simulator-software-in-the-loop>` 和 "
":ref:`MAVProxy 文档 <mavproxy:home>` 用于 *Copter* 测试的基本操作说明。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-sitl-mavproxy-tutorial.rst:12
#: 492cd3a86acf45c38e8b41235a361917
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-sitl-mavproxy-tutorial.rst:14
#: 07f0d6c6b61b43c596279038aec42ff4
msgid ""
"The article is intended primarily for developers who want to test new "
"Copter builds and bug fixes using SITL and *MAVProxy*. It shows how to "
"take off, fly in ``GUIDED`` mode, run missions, set a geofence, and "
"perform a number of other basic testing tasks."
msgstr ""
"本文主要面向希望使用 SITL（软件在环仿真）和 *MAVProxy* 测试新 Copter 构建和修复 bug 的开发者。它展示了如何起飞、在 "
"``GUIDED`` 模式下飞行、运行任务、设置地理围栏以及执行其他多项基本测试任务。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-sitl-mavproxy-tutorial.rst:19
#: 0e70ddd3d0204b83b9cca386bb274adc
msgid ""
"The tutorial is complementary to the topic :ref:`Using SITL for ArduPilot"
" Testing <using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing>`."
msgstr ""
"本教程是 :ref:`Using SITL for ArduPilot Testing <using-sitl-for-ardupilot-"
"testing>` 主题的补充内容。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-sitl-mavproxy-tutorial.rst:23
#: d6f1d45c6a4240edb99a7d3b4e9cba07
msgid ""
"We use *MAVProxy* here, but you can :ref:`attach another ground station "
"to SITL <using-sitl-for-ardupilot-"
"testing_connecting_otheradditional_ground_stations>` if you prefer "
"(similar instructions can be used in any GCS)."
msgstr ""
"我们在此使用 *MAVProxy*，但如果您更喜欢，也可以 :ref:`将其他地面站连接到 SITL（软件在环仿真） <using-sitl-"
"for-ardupilot-testing_connecting_otheradditional_ground_stations>` "
"（类似的说明适用于任何地面站）。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-sitl-mavproxy-tutorial.rst:25
#: 6e03fe5d462546639b47fbccfb7a0fd4
msgid ""
"This tutorial is for Copter - see :ref:`Plane <plane-sitlmavproxy-"
"tutorial>` and :ref:`Rover <rover-sitlmavproxy-tutorial>` for similar "
"tutorials on the other vehicles."
msgstr ""
"本教程适用于 Copter——请参阅 :ref:`Plane <plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial>` 和 "
":ref:`Rover <rover-sitlmavproxy-tutorial>` 获取其他飞行器的类似教程。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-sitl-mavproxy-tutorial.rst:30
#: 23e5662dc1324401b78a97ef2ae8b48d
msgid "Preconditions"
msgstr "前提条件"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-sitl-mavproxy-tutorial.rst:32
#: d96c0d2d50f04d5a9adc94e570c9664d
msgid ""
"The tutorial assumes you have already set up :ref:`SITL on Windows <sitl-"
"native-on-windows>` or :ref:`Linux <setting-up-sitl-on-linux>` and that "
"you have started SITL using the ``--map`` and ``--console`` options:"
msgstr ""
"本教程假设您已经在 :ref:`Windows <sitl-native-on-windows>` 或 :ref:`Linux <setting-"
"up-sitl-on-linux>` 上设置好 SITL（软件在环仿真），并且已使用 ``--map`` 和 ``--console`` 选项启动"
" SITL（软件在环仿真）："

#: ../../source/docs/copter-sitl-mavproxy-tutorial.rst:43
#: b6f1402ee8c3496a8ebcee6253978112
msgid ""
"If you wish to start the simulation at a different map location or use a "
"different frame type (-f option for hexa,tri,octa,heli,etc.) than a "
"standard + layout quadcopter, see :ref:`SITL Advance Testing <using-sitl-"
"for-ardupilot-testing>`. A complete list of startup options for the "
"simulator can be found using the --help option:"
msgstr ""
"如果希望在不同的地图位置启动仿真，或使用与标准 + 布局四旋翼不同的机架类型（hexa、tri、octa、heli 等使用 -f 选项），请参阅 "
":ref:`SITL 高级测试 <using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing>`。仿真器的完整启动选项列表可通过 "
"--help 选项获取："

#: ../../source/docs/copter-sitl-mavproxy-tutorial.rst:53
#: 0a726fa08c674eec9d2e2167d088661f
msgid ""
"The *MAVProxy Command Prompt*, *Console* and *Map* should be arranged "
"conveniently so you can observe the status and send commands at the same "
"time."
msgstr "*MAVProxy 命令提示符*、*控制台* 和 *地图* 应合理排列，以便同时观察状态并发送命令。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-sitl-mavproxy-tutorial.rst:61
#: 8b80395f537f43a192e62dd7b52b9673
msgid "Taking off"
msgstr "起飞"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-sitl-mavproxy-tutorial.rst:63
#: cdd9208998574aca88a2cb9b657e8eb4
msgid ""
"This section explains how to take off in ``GUIDED`` mode. The main steps "
"are to change to ``GUIDED`` mode, arm the throttle, and then call the "
"``takeoff`` command. Takeoff must start within 15 seconds of arming, or "
"the motors will disarm!"
msgstr ""
"本节介绍如何在 ``GUIDED`` 模式下起飞。主要步骤是切换到 ``GUIDED`` 模式，解锁油门，然后调用 ``takeoff`` "
"命令。必须在解锁后 15 秒内开始起飞，否则电机将重新加锁！"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-sitl-mavproxy-tutorial.rst:70
#: 68d2cf5628af4dfab497ba394d5a1c86
msgid ""
"Copter by default only supports takeoff in ``GUIDED`` mode. if you want "
"to take off in ``AUTO`` mode, you need to set :ref:`AUTO_OPTIONS "
"<AUTO_OPTIONS>` parameter to 3."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-sitl-mavproxy-tutorial.rst:73
#: dd2d475d3b1d43a6b9c03335daa5e28e
msgid "Enter the following commands in the *MAVProxy Command Prompt*."
msgstr "在 *MAVProxy 命令提示符*中输入以下命令。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-sitl-mavproxy-tutorial.rst:81
#: 6af368a40c904045a685c5ac6b313586
msgid ""
"Copter should take off to an altitude of 40 metres and then hover (while "
"it waits for the next command)."
msgstr "Copter 应爬升至 40 米高度后悬停（等待下一条命令）。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-sitl-mavproxy-tutorial.rst:85
#: 012b905c141640798022643c2e74dbef
msgid "Monitoring"
msgstr "监控"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-sitl-mavproxy-tutorial.rst:87
#: 5d593715504f49ef95051ae50a699599
msgid ""
"During takeoff you can watch the altitude increase on the console in the "
"*Alt* field."
msgstr "起飞过程中，可在控制台的 *Alt* 字段中观察高度的增加情况。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-sitl-mavproxy-tutorial.rst:90
#: 2ab3389ba65747b8b99082e02fe80860
msgid ""
"Developers may find it useful to **graph** the takeoff by first entering "
"the ``gtakeoff`` command."
msgstr "开发者可先输入 ``gtakeoff`` 命令，以图表方式查看起飞过程，这可能会很有帮助。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-sitl-mavproxy-tutorial.rst:93
#: 767cb3159be345d1971ab06e6547e94a
msgid ""
"For the command to work, you need to set up the alias, the easiest way is"
" to set up the :ref:`MAVProxy startup script <mavproxy:mavproxy-mavinit>`"
" and ensure that the ``graph`` module is loaded."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-sitl-mavproxy-tutorial.rst:99
#: 9b4e324306794ed3930223f10e4757fe
msgid "MAVProxy:Copter Takeoff Graph (gtakeoff)"
msgstr "MAVProxy：Copter 起飞图形（gtakeoff）"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-sitl-mavproxy-tutorial.rst:102
#: ea6e9228fff84b96820571466f1f41d1
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "故障排查"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-sitl-mavproxy-tutorial.rst:104
#: 8b6a32cc2fd64d1c980d6581ac06f5eb
msgid "The most common sources of difficulty taking off are:"
msgstr "起飞困难最常见的原因包括："

#: ../../source/docs/copter-sitl-mavproxy-tutorial.rst:106
#: 6745655e13494592843d6acaae8e5055
msgid "Starting in any mode other than ``GUIDED``."
msgstr "起始模式不是 ``GUIDED``。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-sitl-mavproxy-tutorial.rst:107
#: dc89b0c7ac5341b2b08cb456a22fc329
msgid ""
"Attempting to takeoff when the vehicle is not armed. This can happen if "
"you call ``takeoff`` too slowly after ``arm throttle``, or if the vehicle"
" fails pre-arm checks."
msgstr "飞行器未解锁时尝试起飞。这可能发生在 ``arm throttle`` 后调用 ``takeoff`` 过慢，或飞行器未通过预解锁检查时。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-sitl-mavproxy-tutorial.rst:111
#: f84ed9090efd41f6b8f32f22c3f9b651
msgid "You can list all *enabled* checks using the command ``arm list``:"
msgstr "可使用 ``arm list`` 命令列出所有*已启用*的检查项："

#: ../../source/docs/copter-sitl-mavproxy-tutorial.rst:126
#: b8ae7c97592a48698c7887caa5b1a064
msgid ""
"You can enable and disable checks using ``arm check n`` and ``arm uncheck"
" n`` respectively, where n is the name of the check. Use ``n`` value of "
"``all`` to enables/disable all checks."
msgstr ""
"可分别使用 ``arm check n`` 和 ``arm uncheck n`` 启用和禁用检查项，其中 n 是检查项的名称。将 ``n`` "
"设为 ``all`` 可启用/禁用所有检查项。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-sitl-mavproxy-tutorial.rst:131
#: 453f364a2d104e5ca22f244beb0a1d89
msgid "Changing flight mode - circle and land"
msgstr "切换飞行模式——绕圈与降落"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-sitl-mavproxy-tutorial.rst:133
#: 0f33d4f231b04ef5ab69dc67b2acc76c
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The command below shows how to put Copter into :ref:`CIRCLE <copter"
":circle-mode>` mode with a :ref:`CIRCLE_RADIUS_M <CIRCLE_RADIUS_M>` of "
"20m. This will fly the Copter in a circle at a constant altitude, with "
"the front pointed towards the centre of the circle."
msgstr ""
"以下命令演示如何将 Copter 切换至 :ref:`CIRCLE <copter:circle-mode>` 模式并设置 "
":ref:`CIRCLE_RADIUS <copter:CIRCLE_RADIUS>` 为 2000cm。这将使 Copter "
"以恒定高度绕圈飞行，机头始终指向圆心。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-sitl-mavproxy-tutorial.rst:144
#: 96df4e74bd804525bf5c0c715e71afac
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If you set the :ref:`CIRCLE_RADIUS_M <CIRCLE_RADIUS_M>` to zero the "
"vehicle will rotate in place."
msgstr "若将 ``CIRCLE_RADIUS`` 设为零，飞行器将原地旋转。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-sitl-mavproxy-tutorial.rst:147
#: 19be3555d932403b9718bf193b91fe24
msgid ""
"Copter supports a :ref:`number of other flight modes <copter:flight-"
"modes>`, which you can list in MAVProxy using the ``mode`` command:"
msgstr ""
"Copter 支持多种 :ref:`其他飞行模式 <copter:flight-modes>`，可在 MAVProxy 中使用 ``mode`` "
"命令列出："

#: ../../source/docs/copter-sitl-mavproxy-tutorial.rst:155
#: e8c5532540aa4ae693be8ed3000f7092
msgid ""
"As shown above, you can change the mode by specifying ``mode modename``. "
"Many of the modes can be set by just entering the mode name, e.g. "
"``rtl``, ``auto``, ``stabilize`` etc."
msgstr ""
"如上所示，可通过指定 ``mode modename`` 来切换飞行模式。许多模式可直接输入模式名称来设置，例如 "
"``rtl``、``auto``、``stabilize`` 等。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-sitl-mavproxy-tutorial.rst:159
#: 322e4b832c004e698975e57bc4c50793
msgid ""
"For example, to land right where you are you would use the command: "
"``mode land``. To return to the launch point and then land you would use "
"the command: ``rtl``."
msgstr "例如，就地降落使用命令：``mode land``；返回起飞点后降落使用命令：``rtl``。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-sitl-mavproxy-tutorial.rst:164
#: e150cea337724f75a499bb801f051934
msgid "Guiding the vehicle"
msgstr "引导飞行器"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-sitl-mavproxy-tutorial.rst:166
#: da7d83af6d20427089bdbf74be4280ab
msgid ""
"Once you've taken off you can move the vehicle around the map in "
"``GUIDED`` mode. The easiest way to do this is to right-click on the map "
"where you want to go, select **Fly to**, and then enter the target "
"altitude."
msgstr "起飞后，可在 ``GUIDED`` 模式下在地图上移动飞行器。最简便的方法是在地图目标位置右键单击，选择 **飞往此处**，然后输入目标高度。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-sitl-mavproxy-tutorial.rst:174
#: 6d137789206f44ab8bcb3c70802e5cca
msgid "MAVProxy: Fly toLocation"
msgstr "MAVProxy：飞往位置"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-sitl-mavproxy-tutorial.rst:176
#: 6c11206e2d7a46afbbe44c6bdccbe298
msgid ""
"You can also enter the target position manually on the command line using"
" the two formats below. If only the altitude is specified, the last "
"specified LAT/LON will be used."
msgstr "您也可以在命令行中使用以下两种格式手动输入目标位置。如果仅指定高度，将使用上次指定的经纬度。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-sitl-mavproxy-tutorial.rst:185
#: 87e158febb3f4099ac9daed1d0fa6016
msgid ""
"In addition to ``takeoff``, you can send the following commands in "
"``GUIDED`` mode:"
msgstr "除 ``takeoff`` 外，在 ``GUIDED`` 模式下还可发送以下命令："

#: ../../source/docs/copter-sitl-mavproxy-tutorial.rst:196
#: c68a77d4742e49fa92cbf596d8a4c2fb
msgid ""
"These commands correspond to :ref:`MAV_CMD_NAV_TAKEOFF "
"<copter:mav_cmd_nav_takeoff>`, :ref:`MAV_CMD_DO_CHANGE_SPEED "
"<copter:mav_cmd_do_change_speed>`, :ref:`MAV_CMD_CONDITION_YAW "
"<copter:mav_cmd_condition_yaw>`, `SET_POSITION_TARGET_LOCAL_NED "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#SET_POSITION_TARGET_LOCAL_NED>`__."
msgstr ""
"这些命令分别对应 :ref:`MAV_CMD_NAV_TAKEOFF "
"<copter:mav_cmd_nav_takeoff>`、:ref:`MAV_CMD_DO_CHANGE_SPEED "
"<copter:mav_cmd_do_change_speed>`、:ref:`MAV_CMD_CONDITION_YAW "
"<copter:mav_cmd_condition_yaw>`、`SET_POSITION_TARGET_LOCAL_NED "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#SET_POSITION_TARGET_LOCAL_NED>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-sitl-mavproxy-tutorial.rst:202
#: 39136d9528744b55938aa11b6308fda8
msgid ""
"At time of writing, the other :ref:`Copter Commands <copter-commands-in-"
"guided-mode>` are not supported (`MAVProxy #150 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/MAVProxy/issues/150>`__)"
msgstr ""
"截至撰写时，其他 :ref:`Copter 命令 <copter-commands-in-guided-mode>` "
"尚未得到支持（`MAVProxy #150 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/MAVProxy/issues/150>`__）"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-sitl-mavproxy-tutorial.rst:206
#: e070a3b0116147908bf3d3e4a704f536
msgid "Flying a mission"
msgstr "执行任务飞行"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-sitl-mavproxy-tutorial.rst:208
#: dd4f330b601440d9af670df1412693be
msgid ""
"You can load a mission at any time using the ``wp load`` command. After "
"you've taken off the current mission will start as soon as you change to "
"``AUTO`` mode."
msgstr "可随时使用 ``wp load`` 命令加载任务。起飞后，切换到 ``AUTO`` 模式后当前任务将立即开始执行。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-sitl-mavproxy-tutorial.rst:212
#: 9266a3c725554a35b9d1015b02b04ab5
msgid ""
"The example below shows how to load and start one of the test missions, "
"skip to the second waypoint, and *loop* the mission:"
msgstr "以下示例演示如何加载并启动一个测试任务、跳转到第二个航点，以及*循环*执行任务："

#: ../../source/docs/copter-sitl-mavproxy-tutorial.rst:222
#: f48c24d4ba614f12b1e1c9aaee807115
msgid ""
"The :ref:`MAVProxy Waypoints documentation <mavproxy:mavproxy-waypoints>`"
" lists the full set of available commands (or you can get them using "
"auto-completion by typing \"wp\" on the command line)."
msgstr ""
":ref:`MAVProxy 航点文档 <mavproxy:mavproxy-waypoints>` "
"列出了所有可用命令的完整集合（也可以在命令行输入「wp」通过自动补全获取）。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-sitl-mavproxy-tutorial.rst:226
#: b7ca5e16ead64b6789c6bfef821a23f9
msgid ""
"If you want to create a waypoint mission, this is most easily done on the"
" map:"
msgstr "如果要创建航点任务，最简便的方法是在地图上操作："

#: ../../source/docs/copter-sitl-mavproxy-tutorial.rst:229
#: 0a63fd6c0cbd40a69248085a183682c8
msgid "Right-click on the map and then select **Mission \\| Draw**."
msgstr "在地图上右键单击，然后选择 **任务 \\| 绘制**。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-sitl-mavproxy-tutorial.rst:234
#: 2ffea3422cb749e8a2ba2282e2ef75fa
msgid "MAVProxy: Draw Mission Menu"
msgstr "MAVProxy：绘制任务菜单"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-sitl-mavproxy-tutorial.rst:236
#: 6a2bf56986814795a80315341abca747
msgid "Left-click on the map where you want the points to appear."
msgstr "在地图上左键单击您希望航点出现的位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-sitl-mavproxy-tutorial.rst:240
#: 6f7bb28ba49846199347c5c972bdefc2
msgid ""
"Nothing visible will happen when you make the first click. After the "
"second click, lines will join your points to show the path."
msgstr "第一次单击时不会有任何可见变化。第二次单击后，各点之间会出现连线以显示飞行路径。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-sitl-mavproxy-tutorial.rst:244
#: 1ab6ce7bef73445f9a29f29954fbbaea
msgid ""
"When you're done, you can loop the mission by right-clicking on the map "
"and selecting **Mission \\| Loop**."
msgstr "完成后，可在地图上右键单击并选择 **任务 \\| 循环** 来设置任务循环执行。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-sitl-mavproxy-tutorial.rst:247
#: 121d93173ffa4bf8b46d80651fa0e528
msgid ""
"This approach only allows you to create :ref:`MAV_CMD_NAV_WAYPOINT "
"<copter:mav_cmd_nav_waypoint>` commands. You can edit missions and use "
"other commands on Linux using the *misseditor* module (``module load "
"misseditor``). This is currently broken on Windows. It is also possible "
"to load other types of commands from files."
msgstr ""
"此方法仅支持创建 :ref:`MAV_CMD_NAV_WAYPOINT <copter:mav_cmd_nav_waypoint>` 命令。在 "
"Linux 上可使用 *misseditor* 模块（``module load misseditor``）编辑任务并使用其他命令，该功能目前在 "
"Windows 上无法正常使用。也可以从文件中加载其他类型的命令。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-sitl-mavproxy-tutorial.rst:255
#: d48afc7850734ee6bd1f71d44a33d607
msgid "Setting a GeoFence"
msgstr "设置地理围栏"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-sitl-mavproxy-tutorial.rst:257
#: 9dae34ef9f9a445e8d4c4a8083cebe4f
msgid ""
"A GeoFence is is a virtual barrier that Copter uses to constrain the "
"movement of the vehicle. Copter uses a simple \"tin can border\" as "
"described in :ref:`Simple GeoFence <common-ac2_simple_geofence>`. When "
"the radius or maximum altitude is breached, Copter returns to the launch "
"point and/or lands."
msgstr ""
"地理围栏是 Copter 用于限制飞行器活动范围的虚拟边界。Copter 使用如 :ref:`简单地理围栏 <common-"
"ac2_simple_geofence>` 中所述的简单「圆柱形」围栏。当超出半径或最大高度时，Copter 将返回起飞点并/或降落。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-sitl-mavproxy-tutorial.rst:263
#: 6ed8da823169441a8074c2f0548add0b
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The fence is enabled (and its type selected) using the ``FENCE_`` "
"parameters. You can list the fence parameters with ``param show``:"
msgstr ""
"通过 :ref:`Copter 围栏参数 <copter:parameters_FENCE_>` 启用围栏并选择其类型。可使用 ``param "
"show`` 列出围栏参数："

#: ../../source/docs/copter-sitl-mavproxy-tutorial.rst:276
#: 8c6290e123264929a9eb8d4cb22257a1
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The fence has an altitude boundary of 100 metres (:ref:`FENCE_ALT_MAX "
"<FENCE_ALT_MAX>`) and is bound by a circle of radius "
":ref:`FENCE_RADIUS<FENCE_RADIUS>` around the home location. The "
":ref:`FENCE_TYPE <FENCE_TYPE>` = \"3\" means that both the radius and "
"altitude are used (you can change the type to other numbers have an "
"altitude-only or circle only fence - or none at all). FENCE_ENABLE The "
"fence is initially disabled (:ref:`FENCE_ENABLE <FENCE_ENABLE>` = 0). To "
"turn it on we set the value to one:"
msgstr ""
"围栏的高度上限为 100 米（``FENCE_ALT_MAX``），以 home 位置为圆心、半径为 ``FENCE_RADIUS`` "
"的圆形为边界。``FENCE_TYPE=3`` 表示同时启用半径和高度约束（可将类型更改为其他数值以仅使用高度围栏、仅使用圆形围栏或完全禁用）。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-sitl-mavproxy-tutorial.rst:289
#: 5cf8272023b84f4dbf2450ce5df712b6
msgid ""
"When we fly outside the radius the mode changes to RTL (return to land). "
"If for some reason we travel further out by the value of "
"``FENCE_MARGIN``, then the vehicle will simply land."
msgstr "当飞出半径范围时，模式将切换为 RTL（返航降落）。若因某种原因飞出距离超出 ``FENCE_MARGIN`` 的值，飞行器将直接降落。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-sitl-mavproxy-tutorial.rst:294
#: 2ec62823dd0e48b387aa19ea437afbfb
msgid "Testing the vehicle"
msgstr "测试飞行器"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-sitl-mavproxy-tutorial.rst:296
#: 7e58cbb3781944c29ba0ebde3a94cf7c
msgid ""
"*MAVProxy* allows you to list all the parameters affecting the vehicle "
"and simulation using ``param show *``, and to set any parameter using: "
"``param set PARAM_NAME VALUE``. In addition to affecting the vehicle "
"itself some parameters simulate the performance/failure of specific "
"hardware components and the environment (for example, the wind). These "
"can be listed using: ``param show sim*``. The topic :ref:`Using SITL for "
"ArduPilot Testing <using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing>` explains more about"
" how you can test using SITL."
msgstr ""
"*MAVProxy* 允许您使用 ``param show *`` 列出影响飞行器和仿真的所有参数，并使用 ``param set "
"PARAM_NAME VALUE`` 设置任意参数。除影响飞行器本身外，部分参数还可仿真特定硬件组件的性能/故障及环境因素（如风况）。可使用 "
"``param show sim*`` 列出这些参数。:ref:`使用 SITL 进行 ArduPilot 测试 <using-sitl-for-"
"ardupilot-testing>` 主题对如何使用 SITL 进行测试有更详细的说明。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-sitl-mavproxy-tutorial.rst:305
#: b00756ab72d94911a8f46168c87084c8
msgid "Customizing Launch Location and Parameters in SITL"
msgstr "在 SITL 中自定义起飞位置与参数"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-sitl-mavproxy-tutorial.rst:306
#: 159897ba68e84a479b98124c83997659
msgid ""
"You can start SITL at a specific GPS location using the ``-l`` option "
"during launch. See \"Setting vehicle start location\" in :ref:`using-"
"sitl-for-ardupilot-testing`."
msgstr ""
"启动时可使用 ``-l`` 选项将 SITL 启动在指定的 GPS 位置。参见 :ref:`using-sitl-for-ardupilot-"
"testing` 中的「设置飞行器起始位置」。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-sitl-mavproxy-tutorial.rst:309
#: b1f84b7013ad4790a3342f51482b7f2a
msgid ""
"If you wish to use a specific set of default parameters, rather than "
"manually changing them in the simulation with ``param set`` commands, you"
" can load them at simulation startup from a file. See "
":ref:`SITL_simulation_parameters` section \"Loading a parameter set\"."
msgstr ""
"若希望使用一组特定的默认参数，而非在仿真中通过 ``param set`` 命令手动更改，可以在仿真启动时从文件中加载。参见 "
":ref:`SITL_simulation_parameters` 中的「加载参数集」章节。"

